{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "167a1513365d9d7e4a2420435ae3327f5b8ff2f8537b02d526b8103479ec92be", "ja": "誰も悪くないトラブル", "zh": "谁都没错的小事故", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ac4f97e0ec8238af4e28e664b1b4e0b19e5a2465a7b042a8e9b960548adbd79c", "ja": "イベント期間中のある日。先方都合で予定が\n入り、瑞希は撮影の仕事で地方へ向かう。\n終了後に合流する予定だったが、新幹線の\n遅延に巻き込まれた瑞希は結局イベントに\n参加できず、皆に差をつけられてしまう。", "zh": "活动期间的某一天。由于对方的安排临时有变，瑞希要前往外地进行拍摄工作。\n原本计划结束后与大家会合，但瑞希遇上了新干线延误，最终没能参加活动，被大家拉开了差距。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "eb01a893132b69ef7493c928db815c3ff51c5c84423ac7f49b3941d85e89981f", "ja": "（CD販売イベントは、折り返しを迎えた。\nここまでの成績をまとめた現在の順位は……）", "zh": "（CD销售活动迎来了中场。现在汇总了截至目前的成绩，当前排名是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c7dad0dec9f30cc7c3f40c86996b51a2efdd285f2fbaec0d814ac2c20eb1654b", "ja": "今現在の販売数は、奈緒と昴がトップ争い。\nやや遅れて雪歩、瑞希となってるな。", "zh": "目前的销量，奈绪和昴正在争夺第一。\n稍微落后一些的是雪步和瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "b84c8ab10ac4883ab31a7b7f72101e3071555ef918776bc1f83cf822b561dd1d", "ja": "すっげー！　こうやって数字で見ると、\nなんか説得力あるなー。大したもんだ。", "zh": "好厉害！像这样用数字看起来，感觉特别有说服力啊——真了不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "0240ed8177557cb6e7081c5c59186ec72ce0481862bae891453c94022dccf992", "ja": "でもさ、ファンの人はともかく、\nオレのは家族のサポートっていうか……。", "zh": "不过嘛，先不说粉丝们，我这算是家人的支持吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "dbc9ddd3f8363e9bced14f430b6551c5909d47f6001c7a9f655e1f10afe04eed", "ja": "永吉さんは、兄弟が多いですからね。\nしかし、それもまた、運の強さだと思います。", "zh": "永吉小姐有很多兄弟姐妹呢。\n不过，那也可以说是好运的一种吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "51bf97001f62490eeb99ea61ea4a40745a6c397891d42ce180fa705d7064d9c7", "ja": "せやなー。私も、アニキ達に助けられただけやし。\nもっと、私らのこと知らん人にも、届けたいよなぁ。", "zh": "是啊。我也只是一直受到哥哥们的帮助而已。也想把我们的心意传达给更多不了解我们的人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "745ed2c954c44eaa21e7f6c39da04eb7270a2613b6e75ec33a09c9b896b3e2ee", "ja": "うん、そうだよね。でも、興味を持ってもらうって、\n他にどうしたらいいんだろう……。", "zh": "嗯，也是呢。但是，要让人产生兴趣的话，\n除此之外还能怎么做呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "afab8f59a1034c98b7fb3b44b31e3fc0b386831e8b6f4f29c82338a9efdd7cdb", "ja": "ライブみたいに、もっと大きな声を出すとか……？\nい、いえーい！！", "zh": "比如像演唱会那样，试着喊得更大声……？\n耶、耶——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d2d1b5fb612627bc56c87921e45200c1ab10006a5b8668c0db83478e3c7bcb73", "ja": "そうだな。人を呼ぶための工夫は、\nそれぞれ試してもらって構わない。", "zh": "没错。为了吸引大家过来，各自尝试一些办法也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5869437914731a51175c614334316b5b2d4ac8ec1fa68f173b3cee5de294c437", "ja": "まだまだ全員にチャンスが残っている状況だ。\n後半戦も、気合いを入れて臨んでほしい！", "zh": "现在所有人都有机会。\n希望大家在后半战也打起干劲来全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "5cad27a4fbf7bfef6c9bf5660b8c0eb2883243087a208eec7f77fa8367925692", "ja": "もちろんです！　私も、このまま\n勝ち逃げできるとは思ってませんからね。", "zh": "那是当然的！我也没觉得\n就能这样一路赢到最后呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "75f7f3c32792fdd4cc4cce1acba5835fb7676d67cea13979ae17aed237aecfb6", "ja": "はい。今は、デッドヒート真っ最中。私も、この熱を\n冷ますわけにはいきません。……めらめら、だぞ。", "zh": "是的。现在正是激烈角逐的白热化阶段。我也不能让这股热情冷却下来。……熊熊燃烧着呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7f2214dabb216d34cb2e22b8641e0607a8fa7d97f71572ffe9bb1f5e44ecc3ba", "ja": "ところで、明日は瑞希だけ地方で撮影があって、\n帰ってからの参加になるけど……大丈夫そうか？", "zh": "对了，明天只有瑞希要去外地拍摄，得拍完回来后才能参加……没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "34c19a4b97058937c3339d69224fe12a6d0504b8056cf61d85905caf51536e0c", "ja": "イベント中は仕事が入らないように\n調整したかったんだけど。本当にすまない。", "zh": "本来想协调好活动期间不安排工作，但实在是对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "65a69d9018f9306b44e858bb6a6d7b1ece9382c3802c532aec5c9d8691993de7", "ja": "大丈夫です、問題ありません。\nそれに、先方の都合ですから。", "zh": "没事的，没问题。\n而且，这也是对方的时间安排。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0fc7b7daa9c2f577981bf68fef7730817a1356596617363d595987dcff6e4cdf", "ja": "ありがとう。明日は瑞希に同行するけど、みんなには\n音無さんがついていてくれるから。よろしく頼む！", "zh": "谢谢你。明天我会陪瑞希一起去，不过有音无女士\n陪着大家在。就拜托你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "715aad2ef968af57b84e51abc0845773b0c842281e29f8a51053b68d9e3ae177", "ja": "はい……！", "zh": "好的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f", "ja": "おう！", "zh": "哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1019_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1020_p", "source_sha256": "632a53b201790bfa2cdbb4d0926d273d5530ae4eec2be4c50fee9f595f79da1a", "ja": "（瑞希のグラビア撮影は、無事終わった。すごくいい\n写真になりそうで、そこまでは良かったんだけど……）", "zh": "（瑞希的写真拍摄顺利结束了。照片看起来会拍得非常棒，到这里都还好，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "cffa2f636a9933b7e35272e4cfaad59982c5897d5908299c7735de197a97afba", "ja": "まさか、新幹線が遅延するとは……。", "zh": "没想到新干线居然会晚点……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "83d31cb153c7ae635c693d731f6f18f417ee4d81a60fce478e684786a8bd08c5", "ja": "……。{$P$}。\nまだ、動きそうにありませんか。", "zh": "……。{$P$}。\n车子还是没有要开动的迹象吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1023_p", "source_sha256": "2d39c15071e8440e6be8fa69b9515560c48217613cb130e963696becab0c81ef", "ja": "そうだな……スマホで情報を追っているけど、\nかなり大規模な遅延になりそうだ。", "zh": "是啊……我正在用手机关注信息，  \n看来会是相当严重的延误。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1024_p", "source_sha256": "0417c3434501e2940d6d20d764d5dc71af619331780bb3d9496e9b614e7a8c1d", "ja": "改札や窓口も大混雑だし。\n東京に戻れるのは、夜になるかもな……。", "zh": "检票口和服务窗口也挤得水泄不通。回到东京可能要到晚上了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "15e4688dd2804ff59d8511a78d6a9804db926a33647cbd70071db9a41e39f70c", "ja": "そうですか。\n……イベントは、もう始まっている頃ですね。", "zh": "这样啊。\n……活动现在应该已经开始了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1026_p", "source_sha256": "cdaedfd6cd4331c9d57e8b6b7fe7791f2aafff92412337303acde298c87d767f", "ja": "奈緒達に、仕切り直しを提案してみるか？\n交通機関の遅延は、流石に予想外だし。", "zh": "要不要向奈绪她们提议重新安排？\n交通延误这事，确实在意料之外。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "8bb433133628b0f777ebfbcd73fef46b59019e9c3d3a0225584eab1d9abdbf98", "ja": "いえ。……今日の撮影が押したのは、私が原因です。\n何度か、やり直して頂いたので。", "zh": "不。……今天的拍摄之所以拖延，是因为我。让你们重拍了好几次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "06d1b3aa2a270657e5c66976cc3ffd274714b709ca7d84249491c381b87b1e00", "ja": "あれがなければ、もう少し早い新幹線に乗れました。\nスケジュール通りに移動できたはずです。", "zh": "要不是那样，我就能赶上更早一班新干线了。\n本来应该可以按照日程出发的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1029_p", "source_sha256": "e718270363c2288721a129a379637b1450cb6a7e397fa74595740276bf7244a3", "ja": "それなら俺にだって責任がある。\n当日の移動は、そもそもリスクが高い。", "zh": "既然这样，我也有责任。\n当天出发本来就风险很高。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1030_p", "source_sha256": "1616beff9b19a5601aedb625db9f9b547f9c81a63ce4b9250da2d14ab5859021", "ja": "余裕を持たせるだけでなく、\nもしもの時を考えておいてもよかったんだ。", "zh": "不只是留出余裕，  \n也该提前考虑到万一发生什么情况才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1031_044miz", "source_sha256": "65fb996e27a8fb78f557274c58c406ab0208dcdc1e0776ce5f4df20e8a50ee70", "ja": "……このままでは、お互い、自分の落ち度を\n探しているだけになってしまいそうですね。", "zh": "……这样下去，我们恐怕只会一味寻找自己的过错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1032_p", "source_sha256": "fb8012e425ad1ceddba1a0bc1471c2b8fd40ca200b722fd65f358f80e2ae8ecb", "ja": "ああ……そんな事をしても仕方がないな。\n待とう、瑞希。", "zh": "啊……就算那样做也无济于事。\n等着吧，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1033_044miz", "source_sha256": "99f190a779acf9364a4f26b429f230264c59609f177d65f1c4b7c23f0725b9cd", "ja": "はい、{$P$}。\n……あ。すみません、スマホが鳴って……。", "zh": "好的，{$P$}。\n……啊。对不起，手机响了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1034_044miz", "source_sha256": "ccefef3580f4319cec9994a54872b044fe6d4f2b2ad557776c708a96e5e5d4e7", "ja": "SNSの通知音でした。\n……ふふ。みんな、がんばってるんだな。", "zh": "是社交平台的通知音。\n……呵呵。大家都在努力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1035_p", "source_sha256": "0eaf74a5492e67533dcad1b156c23993a1fd392c54c282f1059e4bc58a6238c5", "ja": "どれどれ……ああ、うん。\nうまくいってるみたいだな。", "zh": "我看看……啊，嗯。\n看来进展得很顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1036_044miz", "source_sha256": "11237133f86750b289d09306b0f6f7ddcb114ab5eea4dc3bdf2361401e74f49c", "ja": "ファンのみなさんが大勢集まって、\n現場は大変な盛り上がりよう。……素晴らしいぞ。", "zh": "粉丝们聚集了许多人，现场气氛热烈非凡。……真是太棒了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1037_044miz", "source_sha256": "a780ccd9e1ddfc4eb8673ddc320725e431eb8bd2ea4d07287eed190cc6214ab6", "ja": "……今回のCD販売イベントは、アイドルのみんなと\nファンのみなさんが直接会える、重要な機会です。", "zh": "……这次的CD发售活动，是偶像们\n与粉丝们直接见面的重要机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1038_044miz", "source_sha256": "bdb62971ce849efc25bf0dfd0e26643b56d13537817857c3c053695d17467cd4", "ja": "そして何より、真剣勝負。\n……私の都合で水を差すわけにはいきません。", "zh": "最重要的是，这是一次认真的较量。\n……不能因为我的缘故扫了大家的兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1039_p", "source_sha256": "4bba4f80503d2fb1c20722ad184712a70dd755e75bbfbc30dbb8298bf2884284", "ja": "そうか。\n瑞希の気持ちはわかったよ。", "zh": "这样啊。\n我明白瑞希的心情了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1040_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1041_p", "source_sha256": "93242065a4fe04b76738e6e412bd57a529f084132b71435cced9e82779cdddf9", "ja": "瑞希、本当にお疲れさま。\n今日は家に帰って体をゆっくり休めてくれ。", "zh": "瑞希，真的辛苦你了。\n今天回家好好休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1042_044miz", "source_sha256": "05c4b21c48b3587a2f4fbad19488f77aafd133ee1b087df3b62d67035700e879", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n次のイベントで、挽回をはかろうと思います。", "zh": "谢谢您。\n我想在下次活动中争取挽回。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1043_044miz", "source_sha256": "6215e9fcef240b36d3e6f1e29fe81097861395d28cf1ba56605590d28c6abdfe", "ja": "とはいえ、今日つけられた差は大きいです。\n……ピンチだぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "话虽如此，今天被拉开的差距还是很大的。\n……这下可不妙了，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_04_1044_p", "source_sha256": "f62332e789e60e3af48a7309deb4bf96723196664dee3e6f08cb40ee23c7dccb", "ja": "（瑞希の言うとおり、真剣勝負ではあるけど……\nこのままというわけにはいかないからな）", "zh": "（不过，正如瑞希所说，虽然确实是场认真的较量……但也不能一直这样下去啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
